e when another plugin already outputs the full OG set; emit the complete set when none is detected.','Directory'=>'Directory','Disable only for headless sites or fully custom hreflang implementations. When disabled, LF no longer removes the WordPress core canonical tag and no longer suppresses SEO-plugin hreflang output.'=>'Disable only for headless sites or fully custom hreflang implementations. When disabled, LF no longer removes the WordPress core canonical tag and no longer suppresses SEO-plugin hreflang output.','Disabled'=>'Disabled','Disabled (by setting)'=>'Disabled (by setting)','Disabled (mode setting)'=>'Disabled (mode setting)','Disabled because the lf-social-share mu-plugin is already providing this feature.'=>'Disabled because the lf-social-share mu-plugin is already providing this feature.','DISALLOW_FILE_MODS is set.'=>'DISALLOW_FILE_MODS is set.','Display'=>'Display','Displays the Lingua Forge language switcher.'=>'Displays the Lingua Forge language switcher.','Do not output any OG tags.'=>'Do not output any OG tags.','Documentation'=>'Documentation','Done'=>'Done','Done — {done} of {total} post(s) fixed.'=>'Done — {done} of {total} post(s) fixed.','Down'=>'Down','Download and install a WordPress core language pack directly from WordPress.org. Once installed, the locale becomes available for URL routing and the AI translation workflow. The list of available languages is fetched on demand — click the button below to load it.'=>'Download and install a WordPress core language pack directly from WordPress.org. Once installed, the locale becomes available for URL routing and the AI translation workflow. The list of available languages is fetched on demand — click the button below to load it.','Dropdown direction'=>'Dropdown direction','edit'=>'edit','Editors and above (edit_others_posts)'=>'Editors and above (edit_others_posts)','Enable API response caching'=>'Enable API response caching','Enable block-level translation cache reuse across posts'=>'Enable block-level translation cache reuse across posts','Enable Social Share URL rewriting for Social Icons blocks'=>'Enable Social Share URL rewriting for Social Icons blocks','Enable when your theme renders the post title as an H2 instead of an H1 (common in some block themes). The analyser fetches the rendered page and, if it finds no H1 but does find an H2, it promotes the first H2 to H1 for scoring purposes.'=>'Enable when your theme renders the post title as an H2 instead of an H1 (common in some block themes). The analyzer fetches the rendered page and, if it finds no H1 but does find an H2, it promotes the first H2 to H1 for scoring purposes.','Enter your API key for at least one AI provider. Keys are encrypted at rest using AES-256-GCM with a site-specific secret (LINGUAFORGE_SECRET). Do not share database exports without rotating the secret first.'=>'Enter your API key for at least one AI provider. Keys are encrypted at rest using AES-256-GCM with a site-specific secret (LINGUAFORGE_SECRET). Do not share database exports without rotating the secret first.','Environment'=>'Environment','environment variable'=>'environment variable','Error'=>'Error','Exclude from navigation menus'=>'Exclude from navigation menus','Expand'=>'Expand','Expected: {expected}'=>'Expected: {expected}','External share services'=>'External share services','Extra guidance — tone, style, constraints, target audience…'=>'Extra guidance — tone, style, constraints, target audience…','Extra guidance — tone, style, constraints…'=>'Extra guidance — tone, style, constraints…','Failed. Please try again.'=>'Failed. Please try again.','Fallback image URL used when a page has no featured image, site logo, or site icon. Shown in social previews for archives, the blog index, and any singular page without a thumbnail.'=>'Fallback image URL used when a page has no featured image, site logo, or site icon. Shown in social previews for archives, the blog index, and any singular page without a thumbnail.','Feature'=>'Feature','Features are grouped into two tiers. Enter the exact model identifier for each tier and provider. Leave a field blank to use the built-in default (shown as placeholder). Only the active provider\'s models are called at runtime — configure the others in advance if you plan to switch.'=>'Features are grouped into two tiers. Enter the exact model identifier for each tier and provider. Leave a field blank to use the built-in default (shown as placeholder). Only the active provider\'s models are called at runtime — configure the others in advance if you plan to switch.','File copied to safe storage successfully.'=>'File copied to safe storage successfully.','File modifications are disabled (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS).'=>'File modifications are disabled (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS).','Files'=>'Files','Files land in the directory below. Useful for diagnosing translation issues — turn off once you have what you need so the files do not accumulate. You can also force this from wp-config.php with `define( \'LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG\', true );` which overrides the toggle.'=>'Files land in the directory below. Useful for diagnosing translation issues — turn off once you have what you need so the files do not accumulate. You can also force this from wp-config.php with `define( \'LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG\', true );` which overrides the toggle.','Filter'=>'Filter','Filter by language and post type, browse your content, and click Analyze on any item to run a rule-based SEO audit — title length, meta description, word count, heading structure, image alt coverage, and internal links.'=>'Filter by language and post type, browse your content, and click Analyze on any item to run a rule-based SEO audit — title length, meta description, word count, heading structure, image alt coverage, and internal links.','Filter with linguaforge_debug_dir to redirect debug output to a non-public location.'=>'Filter with linguaforge_debug_dir to redirect debug output to a non-public location.','Finding'=>'Finding','Fix'=>'Fix','Fix All'=>'Fix All','Fix all links'=>'Fix all links','Fix all parts'=>'Fix all parts','Fix Links'=>'Fix Links','Fix Nav'=>'Fix Nav','Fix Parts'=>'Fix Parts','Fix Template'=>'Fix Template','Fixing {n} / {total}…'=>'Fixing {n} / {total}…','Fixing…'=>'Fixing…','Flush Permalink Rules'=>'Flush Permalink Rules','Flush Permalinks'=>'Flush Permalinks','Flush Sitemap Cache'=>'Flush Sitemap Cache','Footnote Content'=>'Footnote Content','footnote(s) translated — applied together with content.'=>'footnote(s) translated — applied together with content.','Footnotes'=>'Footnotes','Footnotes payload (advanced)'=>'Footnotes payload (advanced)','Forbidden'=>'Forbidden','Forced OFF by the LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG constant in wp-config.php. Remove that line to control this toggle from here.'=>'Forced OFF by the LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG constant in wp-config.php. Remove that line to control this toggle from here.','Forced ON by the LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG constant in wp-config.php. Remove that line to control this toggle from here.'=>'Forced ON by the LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG constant in wp-config.php. Remove that line to control this toggle from here.','Forces the sitemap to regenerate on the next request. Use after bulk-importing or manually editing translation relationships.'=>'Forces the sitemap to regenerate on the next request. Use after bulk-importing or manually editing translation relationships.','Found {parts} across <strong>{total}</strong> of <strong>{scanned}</strong> scanned post(s) for <strong>{lang}</strong>.'=>'Found {parts} across <strong>{total}</strong> of <strong>{scanned}</strong> scanned post(s) for <strong>{lang}</strong>.','From'=>'From','Front Page'=>'Front Page','FSE localisation: scaffold, translate, and fix links in Full Site Editing templates and template parts directly from this tab.'=>'FSE localisation: scaffold, translate, and fix links in Full Site Editing templates and template parts directly from this tab.','FSE templates seeded from the active theme. Create then customise in the Site Editor.'=>'FSE templates seeded from the active theme. Create then customise in the Site Editor.','Full'=>'Full','Full Article'=>'Full Article','Full post'=>'Full post','General'=>'General','Generate'=>'Generate','Generate Content'=>'Generate Content','Generate content…'=>'Generate content…','Generate Excerpt'=>'Generate Excerpt','Generate Meta Description'=>'Generate Meta Description','Generate the multilingual sitemap at /lf-sitemap.xml'=>'Generate the multilingual sitemap at /lf-sitemap.xml','Generated Content'=>'Generated Content','Generated meta description'=>'Generated meta description','Generating…'=>'Generating…','Generation failed.'=>'Generation failed.','Getting started'=>'Getting started','Global AI preset'=>'Global AI preset','Global default (%s)'=>'Global default (%s)','Glossary'=>'Glossary','Glossary entry added.'=>'Glossary entry added.','Glossary entry removed.'=>'Glossary entry removed.','Glossary Tab'=>'Glossary Tab','Google (Gemini)'=>'Google (Gemini)','H2-as-H1 mode enabled — title counted as H1 equivalent. (Heading tags could not be detected from the rendered page; verify your theme outputs the title correctly.)'=>'H2-as-H1 mode enabled — title counted as H1 equivalent. (Heading tags could not be detected from the rendered page; verify your theme outputs the title correctly.)','Headings'=>'Headings','Hide'=>'Hide','Hints'=>'Hints','Home link text'=>'Home link text','How it should appear in the translation. Type the same value as the source term to instruct the AI to preserve it verbatim.'=>'How it should appear in the translation. Type the same value as the source term to instruct the AI to preserve it verbatim.','How to use'=>'How to use','Hreflang'=>'Hreflang','Hreflang output'=>'Hreflang output','Hreflang settings saved.'=>'Hreflang settings saved.','https://github.com/leotiger/lingua-forge'=>'https://github.com/leotiger/lingua-forge','https://lingua-forge.com'=>'https://lingua-forge.com','Icon + label'=>'Icon + label','Icon only'=>'Icon only','If checked, uninstalling the plugin will permanently delete all language assignments, translation relationships, meta descriptions, per-page presets, the AI glossary, and Translation Memory for every post on this site. This cannot be undone. Leave unchecked unless you are fully removing multilingual support from the site.'=>'If checked, uninstalling the plugin will permanently delete all language assignments, translation relationships, meta descriptions, per-page presets, the AI glossary, and Translation Memory for every post on this site. This cannot be undone. Leave unchecked unless you are fully removing multilingual support from the site.','If you have a general SEO plugin installed, this panel shows how LF adapts to avoid duplicate output. The goal is collision avoidance — not cooperation. LF always provides the multilingual SEO layer (hreflang, og:locale, inLanguage schema) that requires knowledge of LF\'s language routing configuration to produce correctly.'=>'If you have a general SEO plugin installed, this panel shows how LF adapts to avoid duplicate output. The goal is collision avoidance — not cooperation. LF always provides the multilingual SEO layer (hreflang, og:locale, inLanguage schema) that requires knowledge of LF\'s language routing configuration to produce correctly.','If you have Yoast SEO, Rank Math, All in One SEO, or SEOPress installed, Lingua Forge detects them and adapts to avoid duplicate output. For hreflang, LF takes over entirely and suppresses the plugin\'s output because those plugins cannot produce correct hreflang for a multilingual routing configuration. For Open Graph, LF adds only og:locale and og:locale:alternate — the multilingual signals the plugin cannot provide — and leaves the base OG set to the plugin. For Schema.org, LF disables its own output entirely to avoid conflicting JSON-LD graphs.'=>'If you have Yoast SEO, Rank Math, All in One SEO, or SEOPress installed, Lingua Forge detects them and adapts to avoid duplicate output. For hreflang, LF takes over entirely and suppresses the plugin\'s output because those plugins cannot produce correct hreflang for a multilingual routing configuration. For Open Graph, LF adds only og:locale and og:locale:alternate — the multilingual signals the plugin cannot provide — and leaves the base OG set to the plugin. For Schema.org, LF disables its own output entirely to avoid conflicting JSON-LD graphs.','Images'=>'Images','Improve writing'=>'Improve writing','In the block editor, add a Social Icons block. For each icon, open the link settings and enter one of the "share:" values below as the URL. On the frontend, LF replaces it with the correct share URL for the current page.'=>'In the block editor, add a Social Icons block. For each icon, open the link settings and enter one of the "share:" values below as the URL. On the frontend, LF replaces it with the correct share URL for the current page.','Includes name, description, inLanguage, url, image, and an Offer with price, priceCurrency, and availability. Price and availability come from the source-language product (shared stock model).'=>'Includes name, description, inLanguage, url, image, and an Offer with price, priceCurrency, and availability. Price and availability come from the source-language product (shared stock model).','Includes site name, url, and inLanguage.'=>'Includes site name, url, and inLanguage.','Informative'=>'Informative','Input tokens'=>'Input tokens','Install'=>'Install','Install a Language'=>'Install a Language','Installed SEO plugins'=>'Installed SEO plugins','Installing…'=>'Installing…','instock / oos / pending from WC stock status'=>'instock / oos / pending from WC stock status','Instructions (optional)'=>'Instructions (optional)','Instructions / key points'=>'Instructions / key points','Integration API'=>'Integration API','Internal Link Fixer'=>'Internal Link Fixer','Introduction only'=>'Introduction only','Invalid file reference.'=>'Invalid file reference.','Invalid filename.'=>'Invalid filename.','Invalid language code.'=>'Invalid language code.','Invalid language.'=>'Invalid language.','Invalid locale code.'=>'Invalid locale code.','Invalid or primary language.'=>'Invalid or primary language.','Invalid post ID.'=>'Invalid post ID.','Invalid post type.'=>'Invalid post type.','Invalid template part.'=>'Invalid template part.','Invalid template type.'=>'Invalid template type.','JavaScript-powered actions'=>'JavaScript-powered actions','Just now'=>'Just now','Key points, ideas, or structure to build from…'=>'Key points, ideas, or structure to build from…','Keys are encrypted with AES-256-CBC before being stored in the WordPress database. The encryption secret is derived from your WordPress auth salts (wp-config.php), so plaintext keys never touch the database.'=>'Keys are encrypted with AES-256-CBC before being stored in the WordPress database. The encryption secret is derived from your WordPress auth salts (wp-config.php), so plaintext keys never touch the database.','Landing / Short-form'=>'Landing / Short-form','Language'=>'Language','Language %s installed successfully.'=>'Language %s installed successfully.','Language (optional)'=>'Language (optional)','Language installation is disabled on this server (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS is set).'=>'Language installation is disabled on this server (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS is set).','Language installation is disabled on this server. The DISALLOW_FILE_MODS constant is set in wp-config.php. Install language packs manually via WP-CLI: wp language core install de_DE'=>'Language installation is disabled on this server. The DISALLOW_FILE_MODS constant is set in wp-config.php. Install language packs manually via WP-CLI: wp language core install de_DE','Language label'=>'Language label','Language Overrides'=>'Language Overrides','Language Overrides: manage custom .po/.mo override files for the Lingua Forge UI strings. Use this instead of editing plugin files directly — overrides survive updates.'=>'Language Overrides: manage custom .po/.mo override files for the Lingua Forge UI strings. Use this instead of editing plugin files directly — overrides survive updates.','Language pack installation failed. The language may already be installed, the locale code may be incorrect, or your server may block file writes.'=>'Language pack installation failed. The language may already be installed, the locale code may be incorrect, or your server may block file writes.','Language Setup'=>'Language Setup','Language Switcher'=>'Language Switcher','Language switcher'=>'Language switcher','Language uninstalled. %d post deleted.'=>'Language uninstalled. %d post deleted.' . "\0" . 'Language uninstalled. %d posts deleted.','Language-specific copies of the theme\'s template parts. Once scaffolded, templates are updated to reference the language-specific part.'=>'Language-specific copies of the theme\'s template parts. Once scaffolded, templates are updated to reference the language-specific part.','Language:'=>'Language:','Languages currently known to the router (derived from installed WordPress locale packs plus the primary language). Install additional language packs in the section below to make more languages available for routing and translation.'=>'Languages currently known to the router (derived from installed WordPress locale packs plus the primary language). Install additional language packs in the section below to make more languages available for routing and translation.','Last 30 days'=>'Last 30 days','Last 7 days'=>'Last 7 days','Last generated: %s'=>'Last generated: %s','Last rule-based SEO score. Run analysis in Settings → SEO → Analysis to update.'=>'Last rule-based SEO score. Run analysis in Settings → SEO → Analysis to update.','Last run: %s ago'=>'Last run: %s ago','Lead paragraph (≤60 w)'=>'Lead paragraph (≤60 w)','Leave a model field blank to use the built-in default for that tier. The placeholder text shows which model will be used.'=>'Leave a model field blank to use the built-in default for that tier. The placeholder text shows which model will be used.','Leave blank for brand names and language-agnostic terms that should be enforced regardless of which language we are translating from.'=>'Leave blank for brand names and language-agnostic terms that should be enforced regardless of which language we are translating from.','Leave blank to apply this entry to all target languages — ideal for brand names, abbreviations, and terms that must be preserved verbatim in every translation.'=>'Leave blank to apply this entry to all target languages — ideal for brand names, abbreviations, and terms that must be preserved verbatim in every translation.','Leave blank to keep the existing key. Enter a new value to replace it.'=>'Leave blank to keep the existing key. Enter a new value to replace it.','Leave blank to use the built-in default. Clearing a saved override restores the default on next save.'=>'Leave blank to use the built-in default. Clearing a saved override restores the default on next save.','Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin'=>'Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin','Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin detected. LF is deferring the base OG set to the mu-plugin and outputting og:locale + og:locale:alternate only. You can deactivate the mu-plugin — LF\'s built-in Social Share (SEO → Social Share tab) and Open Graph cover the same functionality.'=>'Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin detected. LF is deferring the base OG set to the mu-plugin and outputting og:locale + og:locale:alternate only. You can deactivate the mu-plugin — LF\'s built-in Social Share (SEO → Social Share tab) and Open Graph cover the same functionality.','Legal / Compliance'=>'Legal / Compliance','Legal / Compliance instructions'=>'Legal / Compliance instructions','LF always adds og:locale and og:locale:alternate — the multilingual OG signals no general SEO plugin can produce correctly. For the base OG set (og:title, og:description, og:image), LF outputs it when no other plugin is present. When a SEO plugin is installed, LF skips the base set to avoid duplicate tags — not because the plugin is "better", but because duplication produces no value.'=>'LF always adds og:locale and og:locale:alternate — the multilingual OG signals no general SEO plugin can produce correctly. For the base OG set (og:title, og:description, og:image), LF outputs it when no other plugin is present. When a SEO plugin is installed, LF skips the base set to avoid duplicate tags — not because the plugin is "better", but because duplication produces no value.','LF generates its own sitemap with xhtml:link alternates for all translation groups. When a SEO plugin is installed, it generates a separate sitemap — both coexist independently. Submit both to Google Search Console: the SEO plugin sitemap for content discovery, the LF sitemap for language relationship signals.'=>'LF generates its own sitemap with xhtml:link alternates for all translation groups. When a SEO plugin is installed, it generates a separate sitemap — both coexist independently. Submit both to Google Search Console: the SEO plugin sitemap for content discovery, the LF sitemap for language relationship signals.','LF is outputting hreflang tags and has removed the WordPress core canonical tag on multilingual pages.'=>'LF is outputting hreflang tags and has removed the WordPress core canonical tag on multilingual pages.','LF is suppressing hreflang output from: %s'=>'LF is suppressing hreflang output from: %s','LF outputs accurate hreflang for every configured language, including x-default. General SEO plugins have no access to your LF routing configuration and would produce hreflang based on incorrect URL assumptions. LF suppresses their output via filter to prevent collisions.'=>'LF provides precise hreflang tags for every configured language, including x-default. Typical SEO plugins do not access your LF routing setup and might generate hreflang tags based on incorrect URL assumptions. LF suppresses their output through filters to avoid conflicts.','LF outputs multilingual JSON-LD with inLanguage annotations tied to its language routing configuration. When a SEO plugin is installed, LF disables its own schema entirely: duplicate JSON-LD graphs produce validation errors and there is no clean way to supplement an existing graph.'=>'LF generates multilingual JSON-LD with inLanguage annotations linked to its language routing setup. When an SEO plugin is active, LF disables its own schema entirely: duplicate JSON-LD graphs can cause validation errors, and there is no straightforward way to add to an existing graph.','LF provides'=>'LF offers','LF removes the WordPress core canonical tag on multilingual pages because the router\'s language-prefixed rewrite rules and the hreflang x-default are the correct canonical signals for a multilingual site. This prevents a double-canonical if a SEO plugin also outputs one. LF does not add its own canonical — the language routing already makes each URL canonical.'=>'LF removes the WordPress core canonical tag on multilingual pages because the router\'s language-prefixed rewrite rules and the hreflang x-default are the correct canonical signals for a multilingual site. This prevents duplicate canonical tags if an SEO plugin also outputs one. LF does not add its own canonical tag — the language routing already makes each URL canonical.','LF-owned entries currently registered in $wp_rewrite->extra_rules_top. Useful for diagnosing 404s or routing conflicts. Copy these when filing a bug report.'=>'LF-owned entries currently registered in $wp_rewrite->extra_rules_top. Useful for diagnosing 404s or routing conflicts. Copy these when filing a bug report.','Light'=>'Light','Light (default — fast and cost-effective)'=>'Light (default — fast and cost-effective)','Light (fast and cost-effective — Haiku / Flash)'=>'Light (fast and cost-effective — Haiku / Flash)','Light model'=>'Light model','Light: used for meta descriptions and excerpt generation — fast, low cost.'=>'Light: used for meta descriptions and excerpt generation — fast, low cost.','Limit results to pages in the given Lingua Forge language code.'=>'Limit results to pages in the given Lingua Forge language code.','Limits'=>'Limits','Lingua Forge'=>'Lingua Forge','Lingua Forge adds multilingual routing, AI-powered translation, hreflang SEO tags, and a language switcher to your WordPress site.'=>'Lingua Forge adds multilingual routing, AI-powered translation, hreflang SEO tags, and a language switcher to your WordPress site.','Lingua Forge adds WooCommerce-specific Open Graph properties to product pages so that sharing a product URL on Facebook, Pinterest, and similar platforms surfaces the correct product type, price, and availability.'=>'Lingua Forge adds WooCommerce-specific Open Graph properties to product pages so that sharing a product URL on Facebook, Pinterest, and similar platforms displays the correct product type, price, and availability.','Lingua Forge AI Tools'=>'Lingua Forge AI Tools','Lingua Forge extends the WordPress Core Social Icons block with dynamic share URLs. Set any icon\'s link to a "share:" value and LF rewrites it to the correct share URL or JavaScript action at render time — no custom code or third-party plugin required.'=>'Lingua Forge extends the WordPress Core Social Icons block with dynamic share URLs. Set any icon\'s link to a "share:" value, and LF rewrites it to the correct share URL or JavaScript action during rendering — no custom code or third-party plugin needed.','Lingua Forge generates a dedicated XML sitemap at /lf-sitemap.xml that adds language alternate links for all your translated content. This sitemap complements the WordPress core sitemap and any SEO plugin sitemap — it does not replace them.'=>'Lingua Forge creates a dedicated XML sitemap at /lf-sitemap.xml that includes language alternate links for all your translated content. This sitemap complements the WordPress core sitemap and any SEO plugin sitemap — it does not replace them.','Lingua Forge is a complete multilingual SEO solution. No additional SEO plugin is required.'=>'Lingua Forge is a comprehensive multilingual SEO solution. No extra SEO plugin is needed.','Lingua Forge is a complete multilingual SEO solution. No additional SEO plugin or sitemap plugin is required.'=>'Lingua Forge is a complete multilingual SEO solution. No additional SEO plugin or sitemap plugin is required.','Lingua Forge outputs <link rel="alternate" hreflang> tags for every configured language on every page, including x-default pointing to the source language. This is the primary multilingual SEO signal for Google and other search engines — no additional SEO plugin is required.'=>'Lingua Forge outputs <link rel="alternate" hreflang> tags for every configured language on every page, including x-default pointing to the source language. This is the primary multilingual SEO signal for Google and other search engines — no additional SEO plugin is required.','Lingua Forge outputs Open Graph and Twitter Card meta tags so shared URLs display the correct language, title, description, and image on social platforms.'=>'Lingua Forge outputs Open Graph and Twitter Card meta tags so shared URLs display the correct language, title, description, and image on social platforms.','Lingua Forge outputs Schema.org JSON-LD structured data so search engines understand your content type, language, and metadata. This is the primary way to communicate inLanguage annotations for multilingual content to Google and other crawlers.'=>'Lingua Forge outputs Schema.org JSON-LD structured data so search engines understand your content type, language, and metadata. This is the main way to communicate inLanguage annotations for multilingual content to Google and other crawlers.','Lingua Forge restricts two Gutenberg features by default to keep editorial behavior consistent across languages. Opt in here when you need full Gutenberg / FSE capabilities.'=>'Lingua Forge restricts two Gutenberg features by default to keep editorial behavior consistent across languages. Opt in here when you need full Gutenberg / FSE capabilities.','Lingua Forge Settings'=>'Lingua Forge Settings','Lingua Forge uses two independent caching layers to avoid redundant AI API calls. Use the tabs below to inspect and manage each one.'=>'Lingua Forge uses two independent caching layers to avoid redundant AI API calls. Use the tabs below to inspect and manage each one.','Lingua Forge uses two model tiers per provider:'=>'Lingua Forge uses two model tiers per provider:','Lingua Forge version'=>'Lingua Forge version','Lingua Forge — Quick Translate'=>'Lingua Forge — Quick Translate','Lingua Forge — Settings'=>'Lingua Forge — Settings','Lingua Forge\'s built-in Social Share and Open Graph modules cover all functionality the mu-plugin provides, plus multilingual og:locale support. You can safely deactivate the mu-plugin.'=>'Lingua Forge\'s built-in Social Share and Open Graph modules cover all features the mu-plugin offers, plus multilingual og:locale support. You can safely deactivate the mu-plugin.','Link copied'=>'Link copied','link(s)'=>'link(s)','Links'=>'Links','Load available languages'=>'Load available languages','Load content'=>'Load content','Loaded from cache.'=>'Loaded from cache.','Loading…'=>'Loading…','Locale only'=>'Locale only','Locked — a conflicting SEO plugin is active. See the notice above.'=>'Locked — a conflicting SEO plugin is active. See the notice above.','Loco Translate stores its custom translations in wp-content/languages/loco/ — a location that can be silently wiped by a WP core update, plugin reinstall, or if Loco Translate itself is removed. Copying files here moves them into the Lingua Forge i18n-overrides directory, which persists through all of those events and is loaded automatically on every request.'=>'Loco Translate stores its custom translations in wp-content/languages/loco/ — a location that can be silently wiped by a WP core update, plugin reinstall, or if Loco Translate itself is removed. Copying files here moves them into the Lingua Forge i18n-overrides directory, which persists through all of those events and is loaded automatically on every request.','Loco Translate — Copy to Safe Storage'=>'Loco Translate — Copy to Safe Storage','Lowest WordPress capability allowed to trigger AI features. Tightening this on multi-author sites prevents Contributors or trial accounts from running paid AI calls. Override per-feature via the linguaforge_required_capability filter.'=>'Lowest WordPress capability allowed to trigger AI features. Tightening this on multi-author sites prevents Contributors or trial accounts from running paid AI calls. Override per-feature via the linguaforge_required_capability filter.','Maintenance'=>'Maintenance','Maintenance Tab'=>'Maintenance Tab','Make casual'=>'Make casual','Make concise'=>'Make concise','Make formal'=>'Make formal','Mark citations needed'=>'Mark citations needed','Max context characters'=>'Max context characters','Max hints characters'=>'Max hints characters','Max input characters'=>'Max input characters','Max output tokens'=>'Max output tokens','Maximum characters accepted from the input field. Default: 8 000.'=>'Maximum characters accepted from the input field. Default: 8 000.','Maximum characters of existing post content passed to the AI as seed context when no Hints are provided. Default: 6 000.'=>'Maximum characters of existing post content passed to the AI as seed context when no Hints are provided. Default: 6 000.','Maximum characters read from the Hints field. Default: 2 000.'=>'Maximum characters read from the Hints field. Default: 2 000.','Maximum number of characters of post content forwarded to the AI. 0 means no limit — the full content is always sent (recommended). Set a non-zero value only if your provider has a tight context window. A warning is written to the PHP error log whenever the content is trimmed.'=>'Maximum number of characters of post content forwarded to the AI. 0 means no limit — the full content is always sent (recommended). Set a non-zero value only if your provider has a tight context window. A warning is written to the PHP error log whenever the content is trimmed.','Maximum number of tokens the AI may produce in a single translation response. If a translation is silently cut off at the end, increase this value. Default: 16 000.'=>'Maximum number of tokens the AI may produce in a single translation response. If a translation is silently cut off at the end, increase this value. Default: 16 000.','Maximum tokens the AI may produce per generation run. Raise this if full articles are being cut off. Default: 8 192.'=>'Maximum tokens the AI may produce per generation run. Raise this if full articles are being cut off. Default: 8 192.','Maximum tokens the AI may produce per quick translation. Default: 2 000.'=>'Maximum tokens the AI may produce per quick translation. Default: 2 000.','Meta Description'=>'Meta Description','Meta description'=>'Meta description','Meta Description, Excerpt Generator'=>'Meta Description, Excerpt Generator','Metric'=>'Metric','Minimum role'=>'Minimum role','Missing'=>'Missing','Missing pattern name or language.'=>'Missing pattern name or language.','Mode'=>'Mode','Model'=>'Model','Model tier'=>'Model tier','Models'=>'Models','Models Tab (General)'=>'Models Tab (General)','Modified'=>'Modified','Most recent cached block'=>'Most recent cached block','Most recent cached response'=>'Most recent cached response','Multilingual routing, complete multilingual SEO (hreflang, Open Graph, Schema.org, sitemap), and AI content tools for WordPress. Language detection, URL routing, translation, content generation, and a full SEO layer — no companion plugin required.'=>'Multilingual routing, complete multilingual SEO (hreflang, Open Graph, Schema.org, sitemap), and AI content tools for WordPress. Language detection, 