'Technical'=>'Technical','Technical / Scientific'=>'Technical / Scientific','Technical / Scientific instructions'=>'Technical / Scientific instructions','Template "%s" already exists.'=>'Template "%s" already exists.','Template "{expected}" does not exist — create it in the Site Editor first.'=>'Template "{expected}" does not exist — create it in the Site Editor first.','Template has no content.'=>'Template has no content.','Template mode'=>'Template mode','Template not found or not stored in the database.'=>'Template not found or not stored in the database.','Template part "%s" already exists.'=>'Template part "%s" already exists.','Template part has no content.'=>'Template part has no content.','Template part not found or not stored in the database.'=>'Template part not found or not stored in the database.','Template Parts'=>'Template Parts','Templates'=>'Templates','Test connection'=>'Test connection','Testing…'=>'Testing…','Text domain / locale'=>'Text domain / locale','Text to translate'=>'Text to translate','The API Response Cache stores the raw result of every AI request — translation, meta description, excerpt, and content generation — keyed by a hash of the inputs (content, language pair, provider, model). Disable during prompt tuning or when you need every request to reach the AI provider. Disabling does not delete cached entries — re-enabling restores them.'=>'The API Response Cache stores the raw result of every AI request — translation, meta description, excerpt, and content generation — keyed by a hash of the inputs (content, language pair, provider, model). Disable during prompt tuning or when you need every request to reach the AI provider. Disabling does not delete cached entries — re-enabling restores them.','The editor did not accept the content — please try again.'=>'The editor did not accept the content — please try again.','The following directive is active in your virtual robots.txt:'=>'The following directive is active in your virtual robots.txt:','The lf-social-share mu-plugin is active.'=>'The lf-social-share mu-plugin is active.','The lf-social-share mu-plugin is active. Lingua Forge\'s built-in Social Share is inactive — the mu-plugin handles share URL rewriting and the JS actions.'=>'The lf-social-share mu-plugin is active. Lingua Forge\'s built-in Social Share is inactive — the mu-plugin handles share URL rewriting and the JS actions.','The Light tier uses the fast model configured in the Models table above (default: Haiku / Flash). Switch to Quality if you need the same translation accuracy as full-page mode for snippets.'=>'The Light tier uses the fast model configured in the Models table above (default: Haiku / Flash). Switch to Quality if you need the same translation accuracy as full-page mode for snippets.','The phrase as it appears in the source text.'=>'The phrase as it appears in the source text.','The primary language is always served at the root of your site — no URL prefix in path mode, no language subdomain in subdomain mode. All other languages use either a /lang/ path prefix (e.g. example.com/de/) or a language subdomain (e.g. de.example.com), depending on the URL structure setting below.'=>'The primary language is always served at the root of your site — no URL prefix in path mode, no language subdomain in subdomain mode. All other languages use either a /lang/ path prefix (e.g. example.com/de/) or a language subdomain (e.g. de.example.com), depending on the URL structure setting below.','The SEO → Compatibility tab shows the live detection status and explains exactly what LF is doing for each feature area.'=>'The SEO → Compatibility tab shows the live detection status and explains exactly what LF is doing for each feature area.','The share URL always reflects the current page — no manual URL entry needed. The linguaforge_social_share_url filter lets you override the resolved URL for any service.'=>'The share URL always reflects the current page — no manual URL entry needed. The linguaforge_social_share_url filter lets you override the resolved URL for any service.','The sitemap is announced in robots.txt automatically. All major search engines — Google, Bing, Yandex — discover it from robots.txt. No manual submission is required.'=>'The sitemap is announced in robots.txt automatically. All major search engines — Google, Bing, Yandex — discover it from robots.txt. No manual submission is required.','The source page has no footnotes.'=>'The source page has no footnotes.','The upload failed — please try again.'=>'The upload failed — please try again.','The WordPress core sitemap lists all your content URLs. The LF sitemap tells search engines how language versions relate to each other via xhtml:link hreflang alternates. Submit both to Google Search Console for full coverage.'=>'The WordPress core sitemap lists all your content URLs. The LF sitemap tells search engines how language versions relate to each other via xhtml:link hreflang alternates. Submit both to Google Search Console for full coverage.','These footnotes come from the source page and are shown here for reference only. Add them to this page using the block editor.'=>'These footnotes come from the source page and are shown here for reference only. Add them to this page using the block editor.','This is a WooCommerce system page (Shop, Cart, Checkout, etc.). Its content is managed by WooCommerce — the score reflects structural signals only, not user-editable SEO content.'=>'This is a WooCommerce system page (Shop, Cart, Checkout, etc.). Its content is managed by WooCommerce — the score reflects structural signals only, not user-editable SEO content.','This is the source page. Footnotes are edited directly in the block editor.'=>'This is the source page. Footnotes are edited directly in the block editor.','This key is currently supplied by a server %s and cannot be removed here. Enter a new key above to override it with a database value.'=>'This key is currently supplied by a server %s and cannot be removed here. Enter a new key above to override it with a database value.','This language is protected and cannot be uninstalled.'=>'This language is protected and cannot be uninstalled.','This language matches the WordPress instance locale and cannot be uninstalled.'=>'This language matches the WordPress instance locale and cannot be uninstalled.','Tip: to reset a model to the built-in default, clear the field and save.'=>'Tip: to reset a model to the built-in default, clear the field and save.','Title'=>'Title','Title is %1$d chars — may be truncated in SERPs (aim for under %2$d).'=>'Title is %1$d chars — may be truncated in SERPs (aim for under %2$d).','Title is only %d chars — aim for more than 10 characters.'=>'Title is only %d chars — aim for more than 10 characters.','To use a custom encryption secret (instead of the derived wp_salt value), add this to wp-config.php:'=>'To use a custom encryption secret (instead of the derived wp_salt value), add this to wp-config.php:','Today'=>'Today','Token consumption rolled up by feature, provider, and model. Recorded on every successful AI call; Test Connection pings are excluded so they don\'t skew the totals.'=>'Token consumption rolled up by feature, provider, and model. Recorded on every successful AI call; Test Connection pings are excluded so they don\'t skew the totals.','Tone'=>'Tone','tone'=>'tone','Tone:'=>'Tone:','Too many AI requests. Please retry in %d seconds.'=>'Too many AI requests. Please retry in %d seconds.','Total'=>'Total','Total tokens'=>'Total tokens','Translate'=>'Translate','Translate / Revise'=>'Translate / Revise','Translate / Revise block'=>'Translate / Revise block','Translate all'=>'Translate all','Translate chunk'=>'Translate chunk','Translate Content'=>'Translate Content','Translate missing'=>'Translate missing','Translate page…'=>'Translate page…','Translated content'=>'Translated content','Translated Names'=>'Translated Names','Translated title'=>'Translated title','Translated to:'=>'Translated to:','Translated. Review in the Site Editor — internal links, navigation URLs, and template slugs are not updated automatically.'=>'Translated. Review in the Site Editor — internal links, navigation URLs, and template slugs are not updated automatically.','Translating…'=>'Translating…','Translation'=>'Translation','Translation Caching'=>'Translation Caching','Translation found but permalink could not be generated'=>'Translation found but permalink could not be generated','Translation Limits'=>'Translation Limits','Translation Limits & Behavior'=>'Translation Limits & Behavior','Translation Limits: control which user roles can trigger AI translation, and set a monthly token budget. Exceeding the budget suspends AI calls until the month resets.'=>'Translation Limits: control which user roles can trigger AI translation, and set a monthly token budget. Exceeding the budget suspends AI calls until the month resets.','Translation Memory'=>'Translation Memory','Translation Memory caches AI results by content hash, language pair, provider, and model. Editing a post invalidates the cache entry so the next translate call gets a fresh result.'=>'Translation Memory caches AI results by content hash, language pair, provider, and model. Editing a post invalidates the cache entry so the next translate call gets a fresh result.','Translation Memory cleared. %d cached block was removed.'=>'Translation Memory cleared. %d cached block was removed.' . "\0" . 'Translation Memory cleared. %d cached blocks were removed.','Translation Memory setting saved.'=>'Translation Memory setting saved.','Translation Memory: stores the full translated post per content hash. Clear it when you want to force a retranslation of all posts regardless of whether their content changed.'=>'Translation Memory: stores the full translated post per content hash. Clear it when you want to force a retranslation of all posts regardless of whether their content changed.','Translation workflow'=>'Translation workflow','Translation, Content Generator'=>'Translation, Content Generator','Treat H2 as H1 equivalent'=>'Treat H2 as H1 equivalent','Type'=>'Type','Uli Hake'=>'Uli Hake','Uninstall %s'=>'Uninstall %s','Uninstall Behaviour'=>'Uninstall Behaviour','Uninstall setting saved.'=>'Uninstall setting saved.','unknown error'=>'unknown error','Unknown provider.'=>'Unknown provider.','Unknown search engine.'=>'Unknown search engine.','Unlike hreflang — where LF always overrides other plugins because they cannot know your multilingual configuration — Open Graph is different: Yoast, Rank Math, and similar plugins already output correct OG tags for your content. Duplicating them adds no value. In auto mode, LF detects active SEO plugins and adds only what they cannot provide: og:locale (current language) and og:locale:alternate (all other configured languages).'=>'Unlike hreflang — where LF always overrides other plugins because they cannot know your multilingual configuration — Open Graph is different: Yoast, Rank Math, and similar plugins already output correct OG tags for your content. Duplicating them adds no value. In auto mode, LF detects active SEO plugins and adds only what they cannot provide: og:locale (current language) and og:locale:alternate (all other configured languages).','Unlimited'=>'Unlimited','Up'=>'Up','Upload .mo file'=>'Upload .mo file','Upload compiled .mo files to override third-party plugin strings for specific locales — for example, a custom VikBooking translation that uses "apartment" instead of "room". Files must follow the WordPress naming convention: {textdomain}-{locale}.mo (e.g. vikbooking-ca.mo). They are stored in the uploads folder and survive plugin updates.'=>'Upload compiled .mo files to override third-party plugin strings for specific locales — for example, a custom VikBooking translation that uses "apartment" instead of "room". Files must follow the WordPress naming convention: {textdomain}-{locale}.mo (e.g. vikbooking-ca.mo). They are stored in the uploads folder and survive plugin updates.','Upload Override'=>'Upload Override','URL could not be mapped to a post — check the link target exists'=>'URL could not be mapped to a post — check the link target exists','URL structure'=>'URL structure','URL structure: path-prefix mode (example.com/de/) requires no server changes. Subdomain mode (de.example.com) requires a wildcard DNS record, a wildcard SSL certificate, and a web server configuration change — see the Server Setup guide.'=>'URL structure: path-prefix mode (example.com/de/) requires no server changes. Subdomain mode (de.example.com) requires a wildcard DNS record, a wildcard SSL certificate, and a web server configuration change — see the Server Setup guide.','URL to enter'=>'URL to enter','Use native share when available; fall back to clipboard copy. Recommended default for "Share" buttons.'=>'Use native share when available; fall back to clipboard copy. Recommended default for "Share" buttons.','Use the tabs across the top of this page to configure each area. Changes to the Router tab take effect immediately; changes to AI keys and model settings apply to the next AI request.'=>'Use the tabs across the top of this page to configure each area. Changes to the Router tab take effect immediately; changes to AI keys and model settings apply to the next AI request.','User-managed terminology table per language pair. Entries are appended to the translation system prompt so the AI uses preferred terms consistently — critical for domain vocabulary ("kWp", "PPA", "interconnection point"), brand names that must not translate, and standardised regulatory phrasing. Both language fields are optional: leave "Source language" blank to apply the entry regardless of which language you are translating from; leave "Target language" blank to apply it to all target languages at once.'=>'User-managed terminology table per language pair. Entries are appended to the translation system prompt so the AI uses preferred terms consistently — critical for domain vocabulary ("kWp", "PPA", "interconnection point"), brand names that must not translate, and standardised regulatory phrasing. Both language fields are optional: leave "Source language" blank to apply the entry regardless of which language you are translating from; leave "Target language" blank to apply it to all target languages at once.','Using custom meta description.'=>'Using custom meta description.','Using LF AI meta description.'=>'Using LF AI meta description.','Value source'=>'Value source','View'=>'View','View built-in default'=>'View built-in default','View current robots.txt'=>'View current robots.txt','View details'=>'View details','View Lingua Forge details'=>'View Lingua Forge details','Visit plugin site'=>'Visit plugin site','Warning:'=>'Warning:','WcPageBridge active'=>'WcPageBridge active','WebSite'=>'WebSite','WebSite — front page / blog index'=>'WebSite — front page / blog index','What LF provides — and collision avoidance'=>'What LF provides — and collision avoidance','What LF provides: hreflang tags for every configured language, Open Graph and Twitter Card tags with og:locale and og:locale:alternate, Schema.org JSON-LD with inLanguage annotations, and a dedicated multilingual sitemap at /lf-sitemap.xml with xhtml:link alternate entries for all translation groups.'=>'What LF provides: hreflang tags for every configured language, Open Graph and Twitter Card tags with og:locale and og:locale:alternate, Schema.org JSON-LD with inLanguage annotations, and a dedicated multilingual sitemap at /lf-sitemap.xml with xhtml:link alternate entries for all translation groups.','When another SEO plugin is installed'=>'When another SEO plugin is installed','When debug logging is enabled (via the toggle below or by defining LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG in wp-config.php), the Translation and FSE template translation features write their raw AI prompts and responses to disk for troubleshooting. Use this section to monitor that output and clear it once you have what you need — the files can grow quickly on large pages. Configure the destination directory via the linguaforge_debug_dir filter.'=>'When debug logging is enabled (via the toggle below or by defining LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG in wp-config.php), the Translation and FSE template translation features write their raw AI prompts and responses to disk for troubleshooting. Use this section to monitor that output and clear it once you have what you need — the files can grow quickly on large pages. Configure the destination directory via the linguaforge_debug_dir filter.','When enabled, first-time visitors with no language cookie and no language prefix in the URL are redirected to the closest matching language version. The redirect is skipped if the browser\'s preferred language is not among the active router languages. Once a visitor selects a language via the switcher, the cookie takes priority and the browser header is ignored on all future visits.'=>'When enabled, first-time visitors with no language cookie and no language prefix in the URL are redirected to the closest matching language version. The redirect is skipped if the browser\'s preferred language is not among the active router languages. Once a visitor selects a language via the switcher, the cookie takes priority and the browser header is ignored on all future visits.','When enabled, Lingua Forge outputs the following additional meta tags on product pages: og:type=product, og:price:amount, og:price:currency, og:availability, and their product: namespace equivalents used by Facebook Catalog.'=>'When enabled, Lingua Forge outputs the following additional meta tags on product pages: og:type=product, og:price:amount, og:price:currency, og:availability, and their product: namespace equivalents used by Facebook Catalog.','When enabled, the sitemap URL is announced in robots.txt automatically and the cache is refreshed when translated content is saved.'=>'When enabled, the sitemap URL is announced in robots.txt automatically and the cache is refreshed when translated content is saved.','When Yoast SEO, Rank Math, All in One SEO, or SEOPress is active, Lingua Forge automatically suppresses their hreflang output via filter. General SEO plugins produce hreflang based on a single-language URL structure and cannot account for your multilingual routing configuration; LF\'s output is always correct.'=>'When Yoast SEO, Rank Math, All in One SEO, or SEOPress is active, Lingua Forge automatically suppresses their hreflang output via filter. General SEO plugins produce hreflang based on a single-language URL structure and cannot account for your multilingual routing configuration; LF\'s output is always correct.','Which model tier to use for full-page translation. Quality uses the model configured in the Models table above and is recommended for accurate, long-form translation. Switch to Light only if speed or cost is the priority and the content is short.'=>'Which model tier to use for full-page translation. Quality uses the model configured in the Models table above and is recommended for accurate, long-form translation. Switch to Light only if speed or cost is the priority and the content is short.','While active, the mu-plugin handles the base OG set and LF emits locale tags only (auto mode). Removing it switches LF to full OG mode automatically.'=>'While active, the mu-plugin handles the base OG set and LF emits locale tags only (auto mode). Removing it switches LF to full OG mode automatically.','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','WooCommerce is not active.'=>'WooCommerce is not active.','WooCommerce page translations'=>'WooCommerce page translations','WooCommerce product price'=>'WooCommerce product price','WooCommerce SEO settings saved.'=>'WooCommerce SEO settings saved.','WooCommerce store currency'=>'WooCommerce store currency','WooCommerce system pages (Shop, Cart, Checkout, My Account) are excluded — their content is managed by WooCommerce and cannot be improved through SEO edits.'=>'WooCommerce system pages (Shop, Cart, Checkout, My Account) are excluded — their content is managed by WooCommerce and cannot be improved through SEO edits.','WooCommerce version'=>'WooCommerce version','Word count'=>'Word count','WordPress version'=>'WordPress version','WP core canonical active (hreflang disabled)'=>'WP core canonical active (hreflang disabled)','WP-CLI reference'=>'WP-CLI reference','Write AI prompts and responses to disk for troubleshooting'=>'Write AI prompts and responses to disk for troubleshooting','XML Sitemap'=>'XML Sitemap','Yes'=>'Yes','You can also define keys as constants or environment variables (e.g. in wp-config.php). Those sources are used automatically as a fallback when no database key is stored.'=>'You can also define keys as constants or environment variables (e.g., in wp-config.php). Those sources are used automatically as a fallback when no database key is stored.','You do not have permission to manage these settings.'=>'You do not have permission to manage these settings.','You do not have permission to read this post.'=>'You do not have permission to read this post.','{n} stale path(s)'=>'{n} stale path(s)','~%d min read'=>'~%d min read' . "\0" . '~%d min read','— Any source language —'=>'— Any source language —','— Any target language —'=>'— Any target language —','— Any target —'=>'— Any target —','— Any —'=>'— Any —','— Auto-detect —'=>'— Auto-detect —','— auto-detect —'=>'— auto-detect —','— Deferred to plugin'=>'— Deferred to plugin','— Disabled'=>'— Disabled','— Not detected'=>'— Not detected','— select a language —'=>'— select a language —','← Back'=>'← Back','↑ Detected from current post'=>'↑ Detected from current post','→ Locale tags only (manual setting)'=>'→ Locale tags only (manual setting)','→ Locale tags only — deferring base OG to plugin'=>'→ Locale tags only — deferring base OG to plugin','↺ Re-translate'=>'↺ Re-translate','↺ Refine'=>'↺ Refine','↺ Refresh'=>'↺ Refresh','↺ Refresh AI Analysis'=>'↺ Refresh AI Analysis','↺ Refreshing…'=>'↺ Refreshing…','⚠ Borderline'=>'⚠ Borderline','⚠ No <strong>{lang}</strong> posts found. Make sure all translated posts have their Language meta set to <strong>{lang}</strong> in the Language metabox.'=>'⚠ No <strong>{lang}</strong> posts found. Make sure all translated posts have their Language meta set to <strong>{lang}</strong> in the Language metabox.','⚠ No changes'=>'⚠ No changes','⚠ No changes — re-scan?'=>'⚠ No changes — re-scan?','✅ Fixed ({n})'=>'✅ Fixed ({n})','✅ No broken links or template mismatches found for <strong>{lang}</strong>. Scanned <strong>{scanned}</strong> post(s) and page(s) — all checks passed. Template part links (header, footer, sidebar) are not included here — use the Fix Template Parts button to check those separately.'=>'✅ No broken links or template mismatches found for <strong>{lang}</strong>. Scanned <strong>{scanned}</strong> post(s) and page(s) — all checks passed. Template part links (header, footer, sidebar) are not included here — use the Fix Template Parts button to check those separately.','✅ Template fixed'=>'✅ Template fixed','✓ %s notified successfully.'=>'✓ %s notified successfully.','✓ Active'=>'✓ Active','✓ Active at /lf-sitemap.xml'=>'✓ Active at /lf-sitemap.xml','✓ Active — %d URL entry with language alternates'=>'✓ Active — %d URL entry with language alternates' . "\0" . '✓ Active — %d URL entries with language alternates','✓ Active — full OG + Twitter Cards'=>'✓ Active — full OG + Twitter Cards','✓ Active — locale tags only (og:locale, og:locale:alternate)'=>'✓ Active — locale tags only (og:locale, og:locale:alternate)','✓ All parts created.'=>'✓ All parts created.','✓ All templates created.'=>'✓ All templates created.','✓ All translated.'=>'✓ All translated.','✓ Configured'=>'✓ Configured','✓ Connection OK'=>'✓ Connection OK','✓ Content generated — see the overlay to review, refine, and apply.'=>'✓ Content generated — see the overlay to